IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `lia-policies`

-- Life Insurance Act 1995 (Cth), Part 10 and the policy concepts, from the seat of the insured person or policy owner -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_life-insurance-act-1995_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`Chloe's group life cover in her fund, renewed each year` MEANS `My cover` WITH
    `it pays money on a death` IS TRUE
    `it pays on a death only if by accident or a specified sickness` IS FALSE
    `it pays on my injury or disability, or on my being found to have a stated condition` IS FALSE
    `its term in years` IS 1
    `cover of its kind usually runs over 3 years and it is shorter only because of my age at entry` IS FALSE
    `the insurer may alter its benefits or premiums` IS TRUE
    `the only alterations allowed are improvements I accept, or premium changes made simultaneously and consistently for all such contracts` IS FALSE
    `it is consumer credit insurance` IS FALSE
    `it is health insurance` IS FALSE

`Chloe's income protection in her fund, premiums reset each year` MEANS `My cover` WITH
    `it pays money on a death` IS FALSE
    `it pays on a death only if by accident or a specified sickness` IS FALSE
    `it pays on my injury or disability, or on my being found to have a stated condition` IS TRUE
    `its term in years` IS 1
    `cover of its kind usually runs over 3 years and it is shorter only because of my age at entry` IS FALSE
    `the insurer may alter its benefits or premiums` IS TRUE
    `the only alterations allowed are improvements I accept, or premium changes made simultaneously and consistently for all such contracts` IS FALSE
    `it is consumer credit insurance` IS FALSE
    `it is health insurance` IS FALSE

